  "transcript_segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 23.0,
      "text": "One small bloom, then another, brief gold face above the cover."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.0,
      "end": 39.0,
      "text": "I stopped asking for a thunder clap, stopped waiting for the gates."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.0,
      "end": 48.0,
      "text": "Learn to mark this smallest turn and learn to trust the tiny gates."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.0,
      "end": 56.0,
      "text": "One adjustment in the daylight, one repairing the leaves."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.0,
      "end": 64.0,
      "text": "One more way the room grows kinder, one more reason to believe."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.0,
      "end": 73.0,
      "text": "Little steps, living proof, not of crown, not of place."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.0,
      "end": 82.0,
      "text": "Just a flower for the day."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.0,
      "end": 91.0,
      "text": "Open up a small bloom ledger, count the characters not to see."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.0,
      "end": 99.0,
      "text": "Every quiet act of tending adds a pedal to the stem."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.0,
      "end": 107.0,
      "text": "I am not one sudden harvest, I am not a finish wall."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.0,
      "end": 112.0,
      "text": "I am worried, turns each morning."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.0,
      "end": 121.0,
      "text": "With the lantern in the hole, some improvements barely shimmer."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.0,
      "end": 128.0,
      "text": "Some are only felt by roots, some will never draw witness."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.0,
      "end": 134.0,
      "text": "Still they change the living truth."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.0,
      "end": 141.0,
      "text": "I have learned to joy or less, when less in shape with honest hands."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.0,
      "end": 150.0,
      "text": "Power, patience, little opening, you can revise the wider land."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.0,
      "end": 155.0,
      "text": "No grand speech, only growth."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.0,
      "end": 160.0,
      "text": "A flower does not brag about becoming."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.0,
      "end": 165.0,
      "text": "It just arrives where care was kept."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.0,
      "end": 173.0,
      "text": "I keep a record made of mornings not of glory but of breath."
    },
    {
      "start": 173.0,
      "end": 182.0,
      "text": "Open up a small bloom ledger, count the characters not to see."
